<title>FRANCE: LVMH slips after Guinness/GrandMet reaction.</title>
<headline>LVMH slips after Guinness/GrandMet reaction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in LVMH lost some their earlier gains in the afternoon after Guinness Plc and Grand Metropolitan reacted less than enthusiastically to LVMH's drinks merger proposal, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1439 GMT, LVMH was up 2.66 percent at 1,621. It had been as high as 1,637.</p>
